ch is measured by ","attributes":{"color":"#000000"}},{"insert":"Kw (kilowatts)","attributes":{"color":"#000000","bold":true}},{"insert":"; higher the capacity would mean you can driver longer distance with one time charging. Additionally, energy consumption Wh/km does matter as well. ","attributes":{"color":"#000000"}},{"insert":"\n\n","attributes":{"size":"medium","align":"justify"}},{"insert":"Like traditional diesel/petrol cars, the electric models have less efficiency during the ","attributes":{"color":"#000000"}},{"insert":"winter period. ","attributes":{"color":"#000000","bold":true}},{"insert":"Keeping the inside of the vehicle warm in winter is usually the biggest drain on EV range. Lithium-ion batteries used in EVs also do not perform as well in cold temperatures, which can lead to further range reductions. ","attributes":{"color":"#000000"}},{"insert":"\n\n","attributes":{"size":"medium","align":"justify"}},{"insert":"Please use the app ","attributes":{"color":"#000000","bold":true}},{"insert":"by the car manufacturer or car charger provider to access all possible chargers and analyse your energy consumption.","attributes":{"color":"#000000"}},{"insert":"\n","attributes":{"size":"medium","align":"justify"}}]},"hali":"","rType":"richtext"}}},"p":["Gj8q3eIla","k4h7TK8KS"]}},"vvoBVFKvm":{"type":"image","id":"vvoBVFKvm","name":{"rType":"text","val":"Escena 3"},"bg":{"selectedKey":"fill","fill":{"opac":1,"rgb":"#FFF"}},"style":{"selectedKey":"textLabels"},"txtBg":{"fill":{"opac":0.8,"rgb":"#000"}},"e":{"i":{"o0Rf948U1":{"type":"element","id":"o0Rf948U1","link":{"selectedKey":"image","val":"vgjZ7AWFF"},"animation":{"selectedKey":"fade"},"pos":{"x":930,"y":930},"icon":{"selectedKey":8},"size":{"selectedKey":"m"},"iconColor":{"opac":1,"rgb":"#e60000"}}},"p":["o0Rf948U1"]},"t":{"i":{"Gj8q3eIla":{"type":"text","id":"Gj8q3eIla","pos":{"x":60,"y":40},"style":{"selectedKey":"bubbleDown"},"size":{"selectedKey":828},"color":{"opac":1,"rgb":"#e60000"},"desc":{"val":{"ops":[{"insert":"Acceleration and braking","attributes":{"color":"#ffffff"}},{"insert":"\n","attributes":{"align":"center","size":"largeTitle"}}]},"rType":"richtext","hali":""}},"k4h7TK8KS":{"type":"text","id":"k4h7TK8KS","pos":{"x":60,"y":210},"style":{"selectedKey":"boxed"},"size":{"selectedKey":828},"color":{"opac":1,"rgb":"#FFF"},"desc":{"val":{"ops":[{"insert":"Comparing the internal combustion engine, the electric motor is ","attributes":{"color":"#000000"}},{"insert":"more efficient","attributes":{"color":"#000000","bold":true}},{"insert":" due to delivering full torque from the start. ","attributes":{"color":"#000000"}},{"insert":"\n\n","attributes":{"size":"medium","align":"justify"}},{"insert":"An average electric car ","attributes":{"color":"#000000"}},{"insert":"can reach 100km in just 7 seconds.","attributes":{"color":"#000000","bold":true}},{"insert":" For efficient driving, use the conventional braking system only when necessarily, such as at the very end of deceleration, when you're ready to stop the car.","attributes":{"color":"#000000"}},{"insert":"\n\n","attributes":{"size":"medium","align":"justify"}},{"insert":"This will enable your car’s maximum regenerative setting to send extra power back to the vehicle’s batteries while decelerating. You should also make sure your settings are set to ","attributes":{"color":"#000000"}},{"insert":"maximum regeneration.","attributes":{"color":"#000000","bold":true}},{"insert":"\n","attributes":{"size":"medium","align":"justify"}}]},"hali":"","rType":"richtext"}}},"p":["Gj8q3eIla","k4h7TK8KS"]}},"fNmU2IDg1":{"bg":{"selectedKey":"fill","fill":{"opac":1,"rgb":"#FFF"}},"e":{"i":{"o0Rf948U1":{"type":"element","id":"o0Rf948U1","link":{"selectedKey":"slide","val":"xmj22ImRi"},"animation":{"selectedKey":"fade"},"pos":{"x":930,"y":930},"icon":{"selectedKey":8},"size":{"selectedKey":"m"},"iconColor":{"opac":1,"rgb":"#e60000"}}},"p":["o0Rf948U1"]},"lastImage":{"visible":true},"name":{"rType":"text","val":"Escena 4"},"style"